  unitName: Sealed God Lucius
  unitId: 50786
  unitNumber: 1078
  description: A mock Unit modeled after Lucius, the Sealed God. Not only did he
    help the people of Grand Gaia flee to Elgaia after the invasion of the gods,
    but he also opened the gate to Grand Gaia once again to save the world from the
    threat of the Four Fallen Gods. However, since his actual motive was to restore
    balance to the world, Lucius would later grow hostile against the Summoners who
    had once helped him. Though powerful, this mock Unit is considered incomplete
    as it lacks its original counterpart's ability to manipulate the gates.
  summonDesc: I am Lucius...<br>The god who rules the gates...<br>And the keeper
    of all order...
  fusionDesc: Summoner, you do not grasp<br>the true essence of your power...<br>Your
    power is nothing but a curse...
